message: "If you use VSS, please cite it as below."
title: "VSS: an open-source System-One decision intelligence model"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "VSS contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vss-model/vss"
abstract: "VSS is a trainable decision model that answers multiple typed questions (choice, noul, score) about a text/JSON state in a single transformer forward pass, with schema-constrained outputs, probability distributions, and calibrated confidence."
keywords:
  - decision-model
  - calibration
  - transformer
  - abstention
